<title>HONG KONG: Merrill sets Guangdong Inv call warrants.</title>
<headline>Merrill sets Guangdong Inv call warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp;</p>
<p>Co C.V. said on Tuesday it has launched 800 million</p>
<p>American-style call warrants on shares of Guangdong Investment</p>
<p>Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$6.55	  PREMIUM	  19.38 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.1269	GEARING	  5.2X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  1.DEC.97	 MIN EXER LOT   20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$6.55</p>
<p> NOTE		  GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
